  "name": "ScopeMem: Latent Memory That Learns Where to Revise Frozen GUI Agents",
  "notes": "Reviewed the complete abstract and selected v1 controlled-study, method and limitations sections. Results are offline, step-level action matching; online task success is explicitly left untested. The frozen actor is queried twice per step. No independent reproduction or redistribution-license claim.",
  "published_at": "2026-10-19",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "core",
  "summary": "ScopeMem conditions latent-memory prefixes on a frozen GUI agent's initial action and trains them to correct errors while preserving correct decisions. Its evaluation separates action repairs from harmful revisions.",
